@startuml
title EasyBackup 动态架构：备份流程

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowThickness 1.2
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ActorBorderColor #2563EB
  ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "用户" as User
participant "Browser SPA" as SPA
participant "REST API" as REST
participant "Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "OperationManager" as Manager
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "BackupEngine" as Backup
participant "Scanner / Delta /\nArchive Modules" as Engine
collections "Local / S3\nBlobStore" as Store
participant "EventBus" as Events

User -> SPA : 点击运行
SPA -> REST : POST /tasks/{id}/run
REST -> Manager : start_backup(task_id)
Scheduler -> Manager : Cron 触发同一入口
Manager -> DB : 校验任务并创建 queued Operation
Manager -> Backup : asyncio.to_thread(backup_and_prune)

Backup -> Backup : 获取 TaskLock\n拒绝未对账 RUNNING Snapshot
Backup -> Store : LeaseGuard 获取任务级 TTL 租约
Backup -> DB : 在锁内选择 lineage\n判断 full_due / 存储或源变化
Backup -> DB : 插入 RUNNING Snapshot
Backup -> Engine : 扫描、变化识别与 SHA-256

alt 新链 / 强制全量 / full_every 到期
  Engine -> Engine : 全部文件进入多分卷规划\n大文件完整 Base 独占分卷
else 当前链增量
  Engine -> Engine : 未变化文件沿用历史对象\n小变化文件进入多分卷
  loop 每个达到 delta_threshold_mb 的变化大文件
    Backup -> DB : 查询当前链、当前路径的完整 Base
    alt Base 可验证且 xdelta3 / zstd 可用
      Engine -> Engine : 固定 Current\nxdelta3(Base, Current) → Patch\nzstd 压缩
      Engine -> Engine : 立即反向解码\n校验目标大小与 SHA-256
      alt Patch < delta_max_ratio × 原文件
        Backup -> Store : 上传 .vcdiff.zst
        Backup -> DB : 暂存 delta → Base ID
      else 收益不足
        Engine -> Engine : 回退独立完整分卷
      end
    else 无 Base / 工具缺失 / 验证失败
      Engine -> Engine : 回退独立完整分卷
    end
  end
end

Backup -> Store : 流式上传 tar.zst / tar.gz 分卷\n记录对象 SHA-256 + block CRC32
Backup -> Engine : 再次确认源文件未变化
Backup -> Store : 上传 manifest.json
Backup -> Store : LeaseGuard.ensure_valid()
Backup -> Store : 最后发布 commit.json
Backup -> DB : commit_snapshot 原子更新\nsnapshot + file_versions + file_state

Backup --> Manager : 结果 / 进度回调
Manager -> DB : 持久化 Operation 状态与统计
Manager -> Events : 发布状态事件
Events --> SPA : WebSocket 实时更新
Backup -> Store : 释放远端租约
Manager --> REST : 返回可查询 Operation
REST --> SPA : REST 状态为事实来源

note over Engine,Store
  Base-relative：同一链内每个 Patch 都直接依赖该文件的完整 Base，
  不形成 Patch1 → Patch2 → Patch3 的串行依赖链。
end note

note over Backup,DB
  commit.json 发布前失败且仍持有租约：逆序清理未发布对象并标记失败。
  Commit 已发布但 SQLite 提交失败：保留远端证据，由启动/周期对账补全。
end note

note over Manager,Backup
  快照提交后执行 best-effort 保留清理；
  清理失败会记录日志，但不会把有效备份改成失败。
end note

@enduml
